@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state AccountCreation <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state ApplicationSubmission <<choice>>
state PaymentConfirmation <<choice>>
state ApplicationAcceptance <<choice>>
state StatusView <<choice>>
state StatusCheck <<choice>>
state CancellationRequest <<choice>>
state DetailsModification <<choice>>
state FeedbackGiven <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>

AccountCreation:! [*] --> Login: CreateAccount
Login: [CreateAccount] --> ApplicationSubmission: Login
ApplicationSubmission: [Login] --> PaymentConfirmation: SubmitApplication
PaymentConfirmation: [SubmitApplication] --> ApplicationAcceptance: AcceptApplication
ApplicationAcceptance: [AcceptApplication] --> StatusView: ViewStatus
StatusView: [ViewStatus] --> StatusCheck: CheckStatus
CancellationRequest: Login --> CancellationRequest: RequestCancel
DetailsModification: Login --> DetailsModification: ModifyDetails
FeedbackGiven: StatusCheck --> FeedbackGiven: GiveFeedback
Logout: DetailsModification | FeedbackGiven | ApplicationAcceptance | StatusView | CancellationRequest --> Logout: LogOut
StatusCheck: [CheckStatus] --> (PaymentConfirmation): RejectApplication
ApplicationAcceptance: [AcceptApplication] --> (CancellationRequest): CancelApplication
@enduml
